# CODEOWNERS
# GitHub auto-requests review from the owner of each changed path.
# Later matches take precedence, so the catch-all is first and the
# tooling/governance overrides follow.
#
# Split rationale:
#   - Application code        -> owners  (approval authority)
#   - Tooling & governance    -> devops  (they maintain the machinery;
#                                          protects the tracking system
#                                          from silent changes)
#
# Team membership (by design — authorship is separate from approval):
#   - devops: belomed, ccaagbay, SLW-Crux
#   - owners: belomed, SLW-Crux   (ccaagbay is NOT an approver)
# ccaagbay commits application code but cannot approve it; their app-code
# PRs are approved by belomed or SLW-Crux. As the team grows, add reviewers
# to the relevant team — no edits needed here.

# Default owner for everything (application code)
*                            @Belo-Medical-Group/owners

# Tooling & governance — owned by devops
/.github/                    @Belo-Medical-Group/devops
/.githooks/                  @Belo-Medical-Group/devops
/governance/                 @Belo-Medical-Group/devops
/setup-dev-environment.ps1   @Belo-Medical-Group/devops
